## 附加说明 / Additional Notes

This project is part of the **Html九尾狐 / Fox-of-Nine-Tails HTML Studio**
open-source initiative by 汐构科技 (Xigou Tech).

The methodology "Brief + 模板 + 反馈三件套" (Brief + Templates + Feedback
trio) is documented in `docs/DESIGN.md` and is shared openly for the community
to build upon.

For commercial licensing or enterprise support, contact: opensource@xigou.tech
